---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/ui/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Button from '@/components/ui/Button.astro';
import Icon from '@/components/ui/Icon.astro';
import TurkeyMap from '@/components/product/TurkeyMap.astro';
import { imageUrl } from '@lib/images';
import { site } from '@lib/site';
const wall = [
  'sample-workshop-1',
  'sample-workshop-2',
  'sample-workshop-3',
  'sample-room-1',
  'sample-room-2',
  'sample-room-3',
];
const different = [
  {
    icon: 'flip',
    title: 'I flip every rug on camera',
    body: 'The back of a rug tells the truth. You get the video, not my word.',
  },
  {
    icon: 'duties',
    title: 'One price, duties included',
    body: 'No “special price for you.” No customs bill at the door. The number on the page is the number.',
  },
  {
    icon: 'returns',
    title: '30 days to live with it',
    body: 'Rugs look different in your light than on a screen. Take a month. Send it back if it’s wrong.',
  },
  {
    icon: 'us-support',
    title: 'A US business that answers',
    body: 'Text, call, or book a video look. You’re dealing with me, not a ticket queue.',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About · why I flip every rug"
  description="Chris sources and films every rug on location in Turkey. The story, the sourcing map, and why prices are fixed and honest."
>
  <div class="container-content pt-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About' }]} />
  </div>
  <section class="container-content mt-6 grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <img
      src={imageUrl('sample-founder', 'gallery')}
      alt={`${site.founder} standing beside a loom in a Turkish workshop [EDIT: real photo]`}
      width="1200"
      height="1500"
      fetchpriority="high"
      decoding="async"
      class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-card object-cover"
    />
    <div>
      <p class="text-small font-medium tracking-wide text-madder uppercase">About {site.name}</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2">
        I fell for Anatolian rugs, and for how badly most people get treated buying them.
      </h1>
      <div class="prose-brand mt-6 text-body-lg">
        <p>
          [EDIT] The first rug I bought in Turkey came with a story, a certificate, a dramatic
          discount, and a price that was still three times what it was worth. The second one I
          bought from the woman who made it, in a village outside Uşak, after she flipped it over
          and showed me the knots. That’s when it clicked.
        </p>
        <p>
          [EDIT] So now I go to the workshops myself. I film the back of every rug, meet the people
          who made it, burn-test the fibers, and write down exactly what it is: size to the inch,
          fibers, dyes, knots, age, and every repair. Then I sell it at one honest price that
          already includes the duties and the shipping.
        </p>
        <p>
          [EDIT] No haggling. No “for you, special price.” Just real rugs, verified at the loom,
          from a US business that answers the phone.
        </p>
      </div>
      <img
        src={imageUrl('sample-signature', 'thumb')}
        alt={`${site.founder}'s signature`}
        width="240"
        height="80"
        loading="lazy"
        class="mt-6 h-14 w-auto"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-content section-pad" aria-labelledby="diff-title">
    <h2 id="diff-title">What we do differently</h2>
    <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {different.map((d) => (
        <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-card bg-sand p-6">
          <Icon name={d.icon} size={32} class="shrink-0 text-madder" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-h4 font-semibold text-indigo">{d.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-body">{d.body}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-sand" aria-labelledby="map-title">
    <div class="container-content section-pad grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 id="map-title">Where the rugs come from</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body-lg">
          Uşak for Oushaks with that glossy, low pile. Konya and Kars for bold village weaving.
          Milas for kilims. Isparta and Kayseri for workshop pieces. And the Istanbul wholesale
          district, where the good dealers buy from all of them.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body-lg">
          I avoid the cruise-port shops entirely. Their prices carry a guide’s commission and their
          certificates carry nothing.
        </p>
      </div>
      <TurkeyMap region="Anatolian (unspecified)" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-content section-pad" aria-labelledby="wall-title">
    <h2 id="wall-title">From the workshops</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-body text-stone">[EDIT: replace with real trip photos and Stream clips]</p>
    <ul class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:grid-cols-3">
      {wall.map((id, i) => (
        <li>
          <img
            src={imageUrl(id, 'card')}
            alt={`Sourcing trip photo ${i + 1} [EDIT]`}
            width="800"
            height="600"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-card object-cover"
          />
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="container-content pb-16" aria-labelledby="fixed-title">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 id="fixed-title">Why fixed prices</h2>
        <div class="prose-brand mt-4 text-body-lg">
          <p>
            Haggling only works for the person who does it every day. Fixed prices mean the designer
            in Denver and the couple on their honeymoon pay the same, and that number already
            includes the costs most sellers spring on you later.
          </p>
          <p>
            Here’s what’s in the price: the rug, the weaver’s and dealer’s margins, insured express
            shipping, US import duties and tariffs, customs clearance, and a returns reserve so I
            can actually honor 30 days. Nothing else.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Values, short version</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-body-lg">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <Icon name="check" size={24} class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-olive" /> Say exactly what a rug
            is, including “unknown.”
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <Icon name="check" size={24} class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-olive" /> Pay weavers and dealers
            fairly, in writing, by bank transfer.
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <Icon name="check" size={24} class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-olive" /> No fake scarcity. “One
            of one” is simply true.
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <Icon name="check" size={24} class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-olive" /> Answer the phone.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <Button href="/contact">Get in touch</Button>
          <Button href="/book" variant="ghost">
            Book a live look
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
